---
title: "process_proposer_lookahead (Fulu -- The Beacon Chain)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_calc_offset: last_epoch_start = len(state.proposer_lookahead) - SLOTS_PER_EPOCH
    q_calc_offset --> q_shift: state.proposer_lookahead[:last_epoch_start] = state.proposer_lookahead[SLOTS_PER_EPOCH:]
    q_shift --> q_compute: last_epoch_proposers = get_beacon_proposer_indices(state, get_current_epoch(state) + MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD + 1)
    q_compute --> q_fill: state.proposer_lookahead[last_epoch_start:] = last_epoch_proposers
    q_fill --> [*]: return
    note right of q_fill
        INV-001: Shift removes the earliest epoch's proposers (SLOTS_PER_EPOCH entries)
        INV-002: New proposers are computed for epoch N + MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD + 1 at epoch N boundary
        INV-003: proposer_lookahead length remains (MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD + 1) * SLOTS_PER_EPOCH
        INV-004: At start of epoch N, lookahead for epoch N+1 is available in state
    end note
